    "notes": [
      "112 is free and can be called with the phone locked or without credit, and it integrates 110 (police), 113 (fire) and 119 (ambulance). But Call Center 112 is run separately by each local government: by 2024 more than 70 cities/regencies had implemented it, so 112 may not be answered everywhere. Source: https://layanan112.komdigi.go.id/tentang (Ministry of Communication and Digital Affairs), retrieved 2026-09-26."
